      "name": "GetBnclientInterface",
      "signature": "void * GetBnclientInterface(void)",
      "calling_convention": "unknown",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Returns the global Bnclient.dll interface pointer.\n\n  Algorithm:\n    1. Load g_pBnclientInterface from global storage\n    2. Return the interface pointer in EAX\n\n  Parameters:\n    None - this is a simple accessor function\n\n  Returns:\n    - void* - Pointer to IBnclientInterface if initialized\n    - NULL (0) if Bnclient.dll not loaded or QueryInterface failed\n\n  Notes:\n    - Used as a tick callback for MessagePumpLoop\n    - Interface is obtained via Bnclient.dll!QueryInterface() during InitializeBnclientInterface\n    - The interface uses a COM-like vtable for method dispatch",
