      "name": "InitializeCharacterSelectionPanel",
      "signature": "void InitializeCharacterSelectionPanel(int nCharacterSlot, int nExpansionFlag)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes the character selection panel UI controls for a given slot.\n\n  Algorithm:\n  1. Dispatch any pending control handlers via DispatchPendingControlHandlers\n  2. Get control 0xab (171) and configure:\n     - Set last inventory item to 1\n     - Set unit flags to 1 (visible/enabled)\n  3. Get control 0xaa (170) - text display control:\n     - Validate string ID 0x2722 (10018) for localized text\n     - Add text to textbox with context=7, no newline\n     - Set unit flags to 1\n  4. Get and enable controls 0xa7 (167) and 0xa8 (168) with flags=1\n  5. Get control 0xa9 (169) - expansion indicator control:\n     - Clear bitmask (set to 0)\n     - Set unit flags to 1\n     - If slot exceeds available slots, set bitmask to 1 (show expansion indicator)\n  6. Get control 0xac (172) via tail call (final panel element)\n\n  Parameters:\n    nCharacterSlot (ECX) - Character slot index (0-7 classic, 0-9 expansion)\n    nExpansionFlag (EDX) - Expansion mode flag (0=classic, non-zero=expansion)\n\n  Returns:\n    void\n\n  Special Cases:\n  - Expansion indicator (control 0xa9) bitmask set to 1 when:\n    - Classic mode (nExpansionFlag=0) and slot > 7 (exceeds 8 classic slots)\n    - Any mode and slot > 9 (exceeds maximum 10 expansion slots)\n  - String ID 0x2722 (10018) corresponds to character selection panel text\n\n  Control Index Reference:\n    0xa7 (167) - Panel element 1\n    0xa8 (168) - Panel element 2\n    0xa9 (169) - Expansion indicator control\n    0xaa (170) - Text display textbox\n    0xab (171) - Inventory/selection control\n    0xac (172) - Final panel element (tail call)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:376f35a539f6a4568436ad96bf42969a",
