      "name": "ShowSimpleMessageDialog",
      "signature": "void ShowSimpleMessageDialog(Unicode * lpszMessage, dword dwDialogType)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Displays a simple modal message dialog to the user with wrapped text support.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Dispatch any pending control handler callbacks from the queue\n2. Determine dialog type (dwDialogType=0: standard, non-zero: alternate layout)\n3. Create UI control hierarchy:\n   - If standard layout: Create background + border + main content container\n   - If alternate layout: Create alternate background + border + content container\n   - Create central text display box in all cases\n4. Set unit flags (active state = 1) for all created controls\n5. Copy message string to local wide-character buffer (0x400 chars max)\n6. Split message by newline characters:\n   - Replace each \n with null terminator\n   - Add text segment to text box via TextBoxAddText()\n7. Return with original EBX preserved (output parameter)\n\nParameters:\n- lpszMessage (ECX, Unicode*): Pointer to message string to display\n- dwDialogType (EDX, dword): Dialog layout type selector (0=standard, other=alternate)\n\nReturns: void (EBX register contains previous handler value passed to caller)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Message truncated to 0x400 wide characters\n- Empty lines preserved (TextBoxAddText called with empty string)\n- No message (first char = \\0) results in empty text box display\n\nError Handling:\n- If pending handler queue reaches 0x40 limit: FatalErrorExit(-1) called\n- FogAssert validates handler count before overflow\n- Dialog creation failure not explicitly handled (relies on CreateObjectByTypeFactory)\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_nPendingControlHandlerCount: Reset to 0, then incremented for each control\n- g_aPendingControlHandlers[]: Array of 0x40 control pointers, populated with new controls\n- _g_pBnetDisconnectHandler: Updated with caller's EBX value on exit\n\nControl Layout (dwDialogType=0):\n- DAT_6fa91f00: Background element\n- DAT_6fa91f90: Border element\n- DAT_6fa91f60: Main text display container\n\nControl Layout (dwDialogType!=0):\n- DAT_6fa923b0: Alternate background\n- DAT_6fa923e0: Alternate border\n- DAT_6fa92410: Main text display container\n",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:2b93282bb8f4cdf7e711a2d287e45eaa",
