      "name": "InitializeGameResourcesAndTextData",
      "signature": "void InitializeGameResourcesAndTextData(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes sprite/CEL rendering resources and converts ASCII text data to Unicode format.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear existing text data list\n2. Initialize BNet client via callback function (interface offset 0x4c)\n3. Validate CEL image format and frame count\n4. Create percentage string using fixed-point division (magic constant 0x51eb851f)\n5. Format percentage into 100-byte buffer using FUN_6fa8547c\n6. If text data list pointer is non-NULL:\n   - Convert ASCII text to Unicode format\n   - Update text data list with converted Unicode text\n\nParameters: None (uses global state)\n\nReturns: void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Buffer is limited to 100 bytes for text conversions\n- Percentage value clamped to 0x64 (100) before formatting\n- Text conversion only performed if g_pTextDataList is not NULL\n- Uses fixed-point arithmetic with 32-bit magic multiplier for percentage calculation\n\nGlobal Dependencies:\n- g_pTextDataList: Pointer to text data structure (cleared and updated)\n- g_pCelImageData: Sprite/CEL image data for validation\n- g_szPercentageFormat: Format string \"%d%%\" for display\n- g_pBnclientInterface: BNet client interface with callback at offset 0x4c",
