      "name": "HandleBattleNetLoginDialog",
      "signature": "uint HandleBattleNetLoginDialog(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Manages Battle.net login dialog flow and message pump processing.\n\nALGORITHM:\n1. Dispatch pending control handlers from global queue\n2. Reset login state and connection flags\n3. Create login dialog UI controls (0xd7, 0xf5, 0xd9, 0xf4)\n4. Build dialog title from locale strings + version info\n5. Invoke Bneclient dialog callback [offset 0x50]\n6. Enter message pump via MessagePumpLoop(FUN_6fa79940)\n7. Check if user cancelled - cleanup and return 0 if yes\n8. Invoke Bneclient connection test [offset 0x74]\n9. Parse text file: detect UTF-16 BOM, convert, wrap lines at 0x21c width\n10. Create UI objects and return 1 on success; call InitializeControlsPanel on error\n\nPARAMETERS:\n(none)\n\nRETURNS:\nuint - 1 if login succeeded, 0 if cancelled or failed",
