      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Wrapper that checks if expansion MPQ file is available.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call CheckExpansionMpqExists to check expansion availability\n2. Test EAX result (0 = not available, non-zero = available)\n3. Jump past RET 4 if available, otherwise perform short return\n4. Return status to caller\n\nParameters:\n  nParam - Stack parameter (purpose unclear from context)\n\nReturns:\n  int - Non-zero if expansion available, zero otherwise\n\nNote: This is a thunk wrapper around CheckExpansionMpqExists with conditional\nreturn behavior based on expansion availability check.",
