      "name": "SetUIExitCode",
      "signature": "void SetUIExitCode(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets the UI exit code to indicate application shutdown.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load immediate value 1 into EAX\n2. Store to global g_dwUIExitCode\n3. Return void\n\nParameters:\n  (none)\n\nReturns:\n  void (EAX = 1 as implicit return value for UI exit code)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  Called during UI shutdown sequence to set exit status flag.\n\nGlobal Variables Modified:\n  g_dwUIExitCode - Set to 1 (exit requested)",
