      "name": "ProcessGameStateTransition",
      "signature": "void ProcessGameStateTransition(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Manage game state machine transitions with UI/data structure initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate save directory by attempting to create marker file at constructed path\n2. Branch on control state value (handlers[0x59]):\n   State 0: File creation succeeded \u2192 inventory/config cleared, create config object,\n     add subcontrols 0xf3/0xf2, register callback, then exit\n   State 1: File missing (default path) \u2192 check flag 0x04 in handlers[0x53]+0x1ea:\n     If flag set: create equipment/stat objects, setup textbox with string 0x14b7\n     If clear: dispatch all objects, clear game/UI, reinit palettes, set config, handlers\n   State 2: Recovery path \u2192 dispatch/clear objects, reinit palettes, set config handlers,\n     mark state=1, set offset+0x204=4, test flag bits\n   State 3: Cleanup path \u2192 similar to state 2 but mark state=3 at offset+0x356\n3. Final check: if flag 0x20 set in handlers[0x53]+0x1ea, OR offset+0x204 with 0x100000\n4. Call StopMessageLoop() and return\n\nParameters:\n(none)\n\nReturns:\n(none)\n\nCritical State Variables:\n- g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x59]: main state machine (0/1/2/3)\n- g_aPendingControlHandlers[0x53]: primary config object pointer\n  Offset+0x1e9: state flag byte\n  Offset+0x1ea: bit flags (0x04=equipment, 0x20=overlay)\n  Offset+0x204: display config (4 or 0x804 based on flags)\n  Offset+0x356: state marker (0x01/0x03/0x04)\n- g_dwGameObjectCount: tracked object array size\n- g_dwUIObjectCount: tracked UI object array size\n- g_bPaletteReinitFlag: triggers palette string comparison and reload\n\nLocal Buffers:\n- abPathBuffer[1024]: full constructed game path\n- szGamePath[260]: game directory path\n- szCheckPath[256]: file verification path\n- szOutputUtf8[256]: decoded editbox text\n- szEditBoxUtf8[256]: source editbox text\n\nError Handling:\n- File operation failure: Jump to state 1 default handler\n- Array bounds violation (count > 0x3F): FatalErrorExit via FogAssert\n- String resource validation: ValidateStringId() called for 0x142d, 0x14b7\n\nDecompiler Note:\nVariables extraout_var, extraout_var_00, extraout_var_01 are ABI stdcall\ntemporaries and do not represent real function state.",
