      "name": "ProcessBattleNetLoginSequence",
      "signature": "dword ProcessBattleNetLoginSequence(char * szLoginName, int nLoginMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Handles BattleNet login sequence and message pump loop.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Perform case-insensitive string comparison of login name against reference\n   - Uses two-byte comparison loop to match entire login credentials\n   - Returns comparison result (0 if match, -1/+1 based on byte comparison)\n2. If comparison fails or early exit triggered, return 0 immediately\n3. If login mode == 0 (normal login):\n   - Dispatch pending inventory handlers for all game objects\n   - Initialize login UI controls (inventory, buttons, display areas)\n   - Set up text display with welcome string ID 0x147b\n   - Assign disconnect handler to SetBnetLoginStateReady\n4. Reset random number generator seed\n5. If login name is provided and BattleNet client interface available:\n   - Copy login name to two temporary buffers (offset +0x225 and +0xd0)\n   - Call external API (Ordinal_10000) with parsed connection data\n   - Enter message pump loop via MessagePumpLoop(FUN_6fa83da0)\n   - Handle wait results: 0=success, 0x102=timeout, other=error\n   - Return status code (0-3) based on connection result\n6. Handle error cases:\n   - Missing login name: Display error string and initialize controls\n   - Invalid connection state: Return 2\n   - No login name provided: Clear login buffers and return 0\n\nParameters:\n  pszLoginName (ECX): Pointer to login name string to validate\n  nLoginMode (EDX): Login mode flag (0=normal, other=alt mode)\n\nReturns:\n  dwReturnValue (EAX): Status code\n    0 = Login skipped/aborted\n    1 = Disconnected during login\n    2 = Connection error/invalid state\n    3 = Login successful/timeout expected\n\nVariables:\n  nCompareResult: String comparison result (-1, 0, 1)\n  pControlInventory: Main inventory/main UI control\n  pControlButtonSubmit: Submit/action button control\n  pControlDisplayArea: Text display area for messages\n  dwWaitResult: WaitForSingleObject result code\n  nEventResult: Result from connection event query\n  pnConnectionData: Pointer to connection info structure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n  0x225: Offset in control config for login name buffer 1\n  0xd0: Offset in control config for login name buffer 2\n  0x147b: String ID for login welcome message\n  0x140d: String ID for successful connection message\n  0x145a: String ID for connection error/default message\n  0x102: WAIT_TIMEOUT code from WaitForSingleObject\n  Control Type IDs: 0xd7-0xd9 (normal mode), 0xf0-0xf2 (alt mode)\n\nControl Flow:\n  Early exit if login name mismatch (line ~0x6fa83ab6)\n  Conditional login mode setup (param_2 check)\n  BattleNet interface availability check\n  Connection state machine with multiple return paths\n  Message pump blocking operation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
