      "name": "ValidateStreamPropertyId",
      "signature": "void ValidateStreamPropertyId(dword dwCodeValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Maps a code value to a handle error code for file I/O operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get the thread-local storage handle error pointer\n2. Store input code value to thread-local storage\n3. Loop through lookup table (DAT_6fa96638) comparing against input value\n4. If exact match found, store corresponding lookup value from table\n5. Check range 0x13-0x24 (19-36): store error code 0xD\n6. Check range 0xBC-0xCA (188-202): store error code 0x8\n7. Default: store error code 0x16\n\nParameters:\n  dwCodeValue - File operation code/status to map to error code\n\nReturns:\n  void (Result stored in thread-local storage via FUN_6fa8a80f)\n\nThread-Local Storage Layout:\n  Offset 8 - Input code value storage\n  Offset 8 - Output error code storage\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n  0x13, 0x24 - Range for error code 0xD (13)\n  0xBC, 0xCA - Range for error code 0x8 (8)\n  0x16 - Default error code (22)\n\nError Handling:\n  All paths store a valid error code. No error returns.\n\nCallers:\n  CloseResourceHandle - Close file handle operation\n  PerformSetFilePointerOperation - File pointer seek operation\n  ReadFileLineWithTextMode - Read text file operation\n  WriteFileWithTextMode - Write text file operation\n  FUN_6fa8ab95 - General file operation handler",
