      "name": "OpenFileWithModeFlags",
      "signature": "dword OpenFileWithModeFlags(char * szFilePath, dword dwAccessMode, dword dwShareMode, dword dwMiscFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Opens a file with specified mode flags and configures stream properties.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate file mode flags from param_2: check 0x80 (shared), 0x8000 (exclusive), 0x4000 (share override)\n2. Set initial file type flags (0x10=shared, 0x80=exclusive) based on access mode\n3. Parse dwAccessMode bits [1:0] to determine file open flags: 0->READ+WRITE, 1->WRITE, 2->READ\n4. Parse param_3 to determine file creation disposition: 0x10->CREATE_NEW, 0x20->CREATE_ALWAYS, 0x30->OPEN_EXISTING, 0x40->OPEN_ALWAYS\n5. Parse file sharing mode bits [10:8]: extract mode mask from 0x700, validate against known values\n6. Validate combined flags; return error 0x16 if invalid combination detected\n7. Allocate stream property slot via AllocateStreamPropertyTableSlot()\n8. Call CreateFileA() with prepared access/share/creation/flags parameters\n9. Retrieve file type via GetFileType() and update type flags (0x40=device, 0x8=pipe)\n10. Store handle in stream property table and set access flags\n11. For special cases (WRITE+BINARY), seek EOF and validate end-of-file marker processing\n12. Release stream slot lock via ReleaseCriticalSectionForStreamSlot()\n\nParameters:\nszFilePath (const char*) - File path to open\ndwAccessMode (dword) - File access mode flags: bit[7]=share, bit[15]=exclusive, bits[1:0]=access type\ndwShareMode (dword) - File sharing mode bits [10:8], disposition bits [5:4]\ndwMiscFlags (dword) - Additional flags validated against g_dwExcludedAttributeMask\n\nReturns:\ndword - Stream index on success, 0xffffffff on failure (error set via GetTlsContextOffsetPtr())\nError 0x16=invalid mode, 0x18=allocation failure\n\nNote: Contains stack-allocated temporaries optimized away",
